  "There is nothing to catch up on. It is not a race, there is no finish line, and the group chat's numbers are mostly fiction.": "根本没有什么进度要赶。这不是比赛，没有终点线，而群里那些数字大部分都是编出来的。",
  "You both decided: before anything changes, get tested together. The polyclinic waiting room is very beige and very quiet.": "你们两个决定了：任何事情改变之前，先一起去检测。综合诊疗所的候诊室非常米色，也非常安静。",
  "Haziq asked you to come with him and Aisyah to get tested. You are the emotional support friend, with snacks.": "哈齐克请你陪他和艾莎一起去检测。你是负责情绪支持的朋友，还带了零食。",
