  "Months later. A quiet evening, a close moment, a hug that goes on a long time.": "几个月后。一个安静的夜晚，一个亲密的时刻，一个持续了很久的拥抱。",
  "Actually... not tonight. Sorry. I thought I wanted to and I don't, right now.": "其实……今晚不要。对不起。我以为我想，但我现在不想。",
