  "Keep pushing.": "继续施压。",
  "BAD END #24 — Not Tonight Means Not Tonight": "BAD END #24 — “今晚不要”就是“今晚不要”",
  "She said no, and you kept going. That is not a misunderstanding; pressuring someone after they say no is abuse, and continuing is sexual assault. Consent can be withdrawn at any time, and \"not tonight\" means stop, immediately and without sulking.": "她说了不，你却继续。这不是误会；在对方说不之后还施压是一种虐待，继续下去就是性侵犯。同意随时都可以撤回，“今晚不要”的意思就是停下来，立刻停，而且不闹脾气。",
  "Bro. Last night Aisyah said \"not tonight\" after we'd planned it. I said okay but I was kind of sulky. Was that bad?": "兄弟。昨晚我们本来计划好了，但艾莎说“今晚不要”。我说好，但有点闹脾气。这样很糟吗？",
  "Haziq is asking honestly.": "哈齐克是认真在问。",
  "\"Stopping was right. The sulking wasn't. Tell her you're glad she said it.\"": "“停下来是对的。闹脾气不对。告诉她，你很高兴她说出来了。”",
