  "Nobody \"leads anyone on\" by changing their mind. Consent can be withdrawn at any moment. Sulking about it is pressure.": "改变主意不叫“撩完不负责”。同意随时都可以撤回。为此闹脾气就是施压。",
  "Another night, a long while later. Something goes wrong: the condom broke. She's frightened. So are you.": "又一个晚上，过了很久之后。出了点状况：安全套破了。她很害怕。你也是。",
  "A 7 AM call from Haziq, panicking. The condom broke last night. Aisyah is frightened.": "早上7点，哈齐克惊慌地打来电话。昨晚安全套破了。艾莎很害怕。",
  "Someone needs to stay calm.": "需要有人保持冷静。",
  "Stay calm. Emergency contraception works best the sooner it's taken: she sees a GP or polyclinic doctor today, and you go with her. Support her decisions, share the cost, plan STI tests.": "保持冷静。紧急避孕越早服用效果越好：她今天就去看家庭医生或综合诊疗所的医生，你陪她去。支持她的决定，一起分担费用，安排性病检测。",
  "In Singapore emergency contraception needs a doctor's prescription, and she sees the doctor herself. The common pill works best within 72 hours; another type works up to five days. Sooner is better.": "在新加坡，紧急避孕药需要医生处方，而且必须是她本人去看医生。常见的那种药在72小时内服用效果最好；另一种在五天内都有效。越早越好。",
  "Panic, blame each other, go silent.": "慌了，互相指责，然后都不说话。",
